Subject: Wire manager AVC feature and UTS ioctl into real SUSFS setters

Target: builtin 1cfa5734 after patches 12-19, paired with common patch 53.
Match userspace d7d04281 feature ID 10003 and write-direction K/102 payload.
Use the existing feature registration/force machinery and manager-or-root
permission checks. No UAPI version bump and no separate fake feature state.
Without the relevant SUSFS configuration, report unsupported.

